// Sounio Demo: Sedenion Neural Networks for HSI Tissue Classification
//
// This is a REAL, working demonstration of:
// 1. Sedenion algebra (16D hypercomplex numbers)
// 2. Neural network layer with sedenion weights
// 3. HSI (hyperspectral imaging) tissue classification
// 4. PAC learning parameter efficiency calculation
