// For basis elements: ||[e_i, e_j, e_k]|| ∈ {0, 2}  (binary!)
// Exactly 168 of 343 triples have norm 2 (order matters).
// 168 = |PSL(2,7)| = |Aut(Fano plane)|
//
// These are the experiential transformations where ORDER matters.
// The "bit" (It from Bit) = the associator. 0 or 2. Nothing in between.
